/-!
# Families of triangulated categories

Generic contravariant families of triangulated categories and their pullback
functors. Stability data on such fibers is added by the weak- and
Bridgeland-stability descendants. Neutral moduli boundedness belongs to the
independent `CategoryTheory/Moduli/` root.

The neutral declarations use the matching
`CategoryTheory.Triangulated.Families` namespace.
-/
